Here is the root cause:
The bug was introduced due to improper handling of routing field names that start with "metadata.". The previous implementation directly checked the field name string, which could lead to inconsistencies and errors when determining whether to store the routing key in metadata or outside of it. This was resolved by introducing a boolean variable to track the state more reliably.

